# report/ holds the write-up. Only the finished PDF belongs on GitHub: the LaTeX
# source, the bibliography, the build script, the generated tables and every build
# artefact stay local. Anything else dropped in this folder is ignored by default.
report/*
!report/report.pdf

# Video recordings. The presentation is submitted and linked as a URL, never committed:
# the files are large and GitHub is not the place for them. video/outline.md is kept.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm
*.m4v

# Smoke-test outputs
reports/smoke/
experiments/smoke/

